  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Sleek, low-top casual silhouette for everyday style\nAiry mesh upper with synthetic overlays\nIconic Nike Swoosh and metallic accents for sportswear style\nLace closure secures a snug, personalized fit\nVisible Max Air cushioning for soft landings and legendary lineage\nCushlon foam midsole provides ample cushioning\nRubber outsole adds durability and grip\nThe Nike Air Max Moto 2K is imported.\nFamiliar yet fresh, the Men's Nike Air Max Moto 2K Casual Shoes bring legendary flavor to your everyday style. Designed by the sneaker legend Tinker Hatfield, who drew inspiration from Parisian architecture, the Air Max Moto 2K brings back performance tech from the 2000s, pairing a lightweight, breathable upper with sculpted lines and Max Air cushioning for an everyday stunner guaranteed to turn heads.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Max Moto 2K Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Light Smoke Grey/Sail/Cool Grey/Coconut Milk/Metallic Silver</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3288168</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"s